# Research run artifacts: keep the human-readable outputs + provenance, exclude
# heavy/transient run state. Patterns are relative to docs/Research/.
#
# Ignore everything one level under each topic folder...
*/*
# ...but keep the report, the summary, and the exact prompt used.
!*/*-research-report.md
!*/SUMMARY.md
!*/PROMPT.md

# (The launcher scripts run_research.sh / watch.sh and this .gitignore live at the
#  docs/Research/ root — depth 0 — so `*/*` never matches them; they stay tracked.)
